{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
PAYMENT ICON LIST
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Prints payment-method logos with Shopify's own artwork (payment_type_svg_tag).

********************************************
Supported variables
********************************************

* source: "custom" (default) prints the names given in "list"; "store" prints the methods enabled in the Shopify
  payment settings (shop.enabled_payment_types).
* list: comma-separated Shopify payment type names, e.g. "visa, master, american_express, paypal". Empty falls back
  to the most used methods in the United States.
* icon_class: class added to every <svg>.
* wrapper: optional tag name (e.g. "li") wrapped around every icon.
* wrapper_class: optional class of that wrapper tag.

A name Shopify has no artwork for renders nothing, so a typo never shows an error on the storefront.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign pil_default = 'visa,master,american_express,discover,paypal,apple_pay,google_pay,shopify_pay,venmo,klarna,afterpay'

  if source == 'store'
    assign pil_types = shop.enabled_payment_types
  else
    assign pil_list = list | default: pil_default | downcase | remove: ' '
    assign pil_types = pil_list | split: ','
  endif
-%}

{%- for pil_type in pil_types -%}
  {%- if pil_type == blank -%}
    {%- continue -%}
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- capture pil_svg -%}{{ pil_type | payment_type_svg_tag: class: icon_class }}{%- endcapture -%}

  {%- if pil_svg contains '<svg' -%}
    {%- if wrapper != blank -%}
      <{{ wrapper }}{% if wrapper_class != blank %} class="{{ wrapper_class }}"{% endif %}>{{ pil_svg }}</{{ wrapper }}>
    {%- else -%}
      {{- pil_svg -}}
    {%- endif -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endfor -%}
